* Value of Nceil (Mathlib's Nat.ceil): the integer ceiling for positive arguments, 0 otherwise.

s1::id |- ( x = X -> x = X )
c1:s1:breq1d |- ( x = X -> ( x <_ 0 <-> X <_ 0 ) )
